  "title": "Lumexa Imaging Announces Fourth Quarter and Full Year 2025 Results, Reiterates Full Year 2026 Guidance",
  "summary": "RALEIGH, NORTH CAROLINA, March 26, 2026—Lumexa Imaging (Nasdaq: LMRI), one of the nation’s largest providers of outpatient imaging services, today announced certain financial results for the fourth quarter ended December 31, 2025, and reiterated full year 2026 guidance. The financial results included in this release pertaining to the fourth quarter and full year 2025 are preliminary, unaudited, and subject to final review and adjustment.",
